# Hostnames Home Assistant reaches via the WAN instead of Mullvad
# (docs/FIREWALL.md, "WAN bypass for Home Assistant").
#
# These services reject VPN egress (HTTP 403 from Mullvad exits). Only the
# hosts the toyota_connected integration contacts for North American
# accounts are listed; nothing broader (no wildcards, no CDN-wide ranges).
# wan-bypass-update resolves them every minute and puts their current IPv4
# addresses into the ipset wan_bypass_ha (1 h timeout per address).
#
# One hostname per line; '#' starts a comment.

# ForgeRock sign-in (authenticate / authorize / access_token), per brand
login.subarudriverslogin.com
login.toyotadriverslogin.com
login.lexusdriverslogin.com

# REST API gateway (vehicle list, status, commands)
onecdn.telematicsct.com

# GraphQL API (HTTPS queries and the realtime websocket)
oa-api.telematicsct.com
